<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "Channel welcome messages are shown once to each user when they join a channel. Operators can set or clear the message from Channel Central's General tab or with commands."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_channels", "When to use it")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "Use it to greet newcomers with what they need to know: what the channel is about, its rules, or where to start. The topic stays visible to everyone all the time. The welcome message is a private note that each person reads once, as they arrive."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_general}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Channel Central")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "Open Channel Central for the channel, stay on the General tab, edit the Welcome Message field, then choose Save Welcome. Use Clear Welcome to remove it."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "Saving an empty field also removes the message."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Commands")}</.help_h4>
<pre>/setwelcome &lt;message&gt;  {dgettext("help_channels", "Set the welcome message")}
/clearwelcome          {dgettext("help_channels", "Remove the welcome message")}</pre>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_channels", "The command with no text also removes the message:")}
  <code>/setwelcome</code>
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_channels", "How it works")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "A person who joins sees the message as a line that starts with Welcome, visible only to them."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "Each person sees it once per session. Leaving and joining again in the same session does not show it again."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "A new message replaces the old one. Members who are looking at the channel when a new message is set get a short notice."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "The message is saved, so it stays after a restart."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Rules")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_channels", "Requires channel operator (@) or owner (~) status")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_channels", "Applies only to the current channel")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "Half-operators cannot set or clear the welcome message."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "The person who set the message is not shown it when they join."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_channels", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="cmd-setwelcome">{dgettext("help_channels", "/setwelcome")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-clearwelcome">{dgettext("help_channels", "/clearwelcome")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-channel-central">
    {dgettext("help_channels", "Channel Central")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="channel-permissions">
    {dgettext("help_channels", "Channel Permissions")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-topic">{dgettext("help_channels", "/topic Command")}</.help_link>
</p>
